      <definition>1 n. Sleep; drowsiness.</definition>
      <page>589</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠣᠶᠢᠷ ᠶᠡᠺᠡᠲᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- jeketei</transcript>
          <definition> Somnolent, inclined to sleep.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠣᠶᠢᠷ ᠺᠦᠷᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- kyrky</transcript>
